Comfortable to wear · Appropriate pressure on the instep · Stable heel','4096085'),('https://www.musinsa.com/products/4786149','날렵한 사이즈에 비해 발안쪽 공간은 여유있어요\n코르테즈265 삼바265\n슈퍼스타260 에어포스260 ...더보기','Size: True to size · Normal foot width · Very comfortable to wear · Moderate pressure on the instep','4786149'),('https://www.musinsa.com/products/4786149','발볼 잇으신분 1업 적당하신분 반업해서 신으시면 쉐입 이뻐요','Slightly small in size · Comfortable foot width · Average fit · Moderate pressure on the instep','4786149'),('https://www.musinsa.com/products/4786149','스웨이드 차콜에 가까워요 다크 그레이 겨울 가을 잘 산을 거 같아요','Size: True to size · Normal foot width · Slightly uncomfortable to wear · Comfortable with no pressure on the instep','4786149'),('https://www.musinsa.com/products/4786149','색감이 이쁘고 무난해서 코디하기 편할거 같아요','Size: True to size · Foot width is normal · Fit is normal · Instep pressure is moderate','4786149'),('https://www.musinsa.com/products/4786149','가을맞이 스피드캣 장만했는데 이 컬러 너무 깔끔하고 예뻐용 때타도 괜찮고 착화감도 편해요!','Size: True to size · Foot width is normal · Fit is normal · Instep pressure is moderate','4786149');
